DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/intel/sinkholes/{sinkhole_id}/ingresses/{ingress_id}
Delete the specified ingress rule. The sinkhole must belong to the same account as the zone.
Required: zone_id (path) — The unique identifier for the Cloudflare zone.; sinkhole_id (path) — The unique identifier for the sinkhole.; ingress_id (path) — The unique identifier for the ingress rule.

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/intel/sinkholes/{sinkhole_id}/ingresses/{ingress_id}
Get the specified ingress rule associated with a sinkhole. The sinkhole must belong to the same account as the zone.
Required: zone_id (path) — The unique identifier for the Cloudflare zone.; sinkhole_id (path) — The unique identifier for the sinkhole.; ingress_id (path) — The unique identifier for the ingress rule.

PUT /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/intel/sinkholes/{sinkhole_id}/ingresses/{ingress_id}
Replaces the specified ingress rule. The sinkhole must belong to the same account as the zone.
Required: zone_id (path) — The unique identifier for the Cloudflare zone.; sinkhole_id (path) — The unique identifier for the sinkhole.; ingress_id (path) — The unique identifier for the ingress rule.; body (body)
